{
  "notes": [
    "Utterances as the recognizer delivers them: each sample is the whole partial heard so far with the time it arrived (words 60-200 ms apart; the last word of a sentence often later). A sample that repeats the previous text at a later time is the caller re-pushing the last partial so a clause can commit by stability; the stream keeps no timer.",
    "The harness (tests/voice-stream.test.ts) drives createClauseStream and decideFast: every committed clause is decided at once with ctx, and after an open_url the ctx's frontHost becomes that URL's host, as the executor knows where it just sent the browser. atSample is the index of the sample whose push produced the event.",
    "finalActions are the decisions on clauses the final commits that never committed while speaking; superseded lists rewrites of committed words. An action equal to the last one issued for the same clause index (a replacement deciding to the same URL) is a repeat and is not issued again. scripts/streaming-report.mjs (lane S3) reads the same shape."
  ],
  "timelines": [
    {
      "id": "owner-youtube",
      "about": "The owner's sentence: YouTube by the boundary at 'play' (word 4), the results for 'midwest safety' by stability before 'video' arrives; 'video' then supersedes the clause with the same URL, which the executor drops as a repeat.",
      "ctx": { "protectedHosts": ["paypal.com", "chase.com"] },
      "samples": [
        { "text": "go", "atMs": 0 },
        { "text": "go to", "atMs": 120 },
        { "text": "go to youtube", "atMs": 300 },
        { "text": "go to youtube and", "atMs": 480 },
        { "text": "go to youtube and play", "atMs": 640 },
        { "text": "go to youtube and play a", "atMs": 760 },
        { "text": "go to youtube and play a midwest", "atMs": 920 },
        { "text": "go to youtube and play a midwest safety", "atMs": 1100 },
        { "text": "go to youtube and play a midwest safety", "atMs": 1460 },
        {
          "text": "go to youtube and play a midwest safety video",
          "atMs": 1500
        }
      ],
      "final": {
        "text": "go to youtube and play a midwest safety video",
        "atMs": 2300
      },
      "expect": {
        "commits": [
          {
            "index": 0,
            "text": "go to youtube",
            "by": "boundary",
            "atSample": 4
          },
          {
            "index": 1,
            "text": "play a midwest safety",
            "by": "stable",
            "atSample": 8
          }
        ],
        "superseded": [{ "index": 1, "atSample": 9 }],
        "actions": [
          {
            "index": 0,
            "kind": "open_url",
            "siteKey": "youtube",
            "url": "https://www.youtube.com/"
          },
          {
            "index": 1,
            "kind": "open_url",
            "siteKey": "youtube",
            "url": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=midwest%20safety"
          }
        ],
        "finalClauses": ["go to youtube", "play a midwest safety video"],
        "finalActions": [],
        "dropped": []
      }
    },
